Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(勿在此地逗留  勿与犯人交谈)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们把那辆车也弄进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get the other car in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它们停在院子西边的入口处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll park 'em in the west entry of the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  车都堆外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Our vehicles camped out there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像在邀请别人进来住宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}look like a giant "Vacancy" sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们还得把尸体堆起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, we need to load up these corpses
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can burn 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.51,0:02:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够干一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna be a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦和玛姬在哪里  我们缺人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Glenn and Maggie? We could use some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哨塔上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up in the guard tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哨塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们昨晚就上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just up there last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn! Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥事呀  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's up, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你来吗  -啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You coming? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You comin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  我们人手不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we could use a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.35,0:03:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们马上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sickos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许再接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们说好的  -拜托  先生  我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had an agreement. - Please, mister. We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是说好了  但你要理解...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a deal. But you gotta understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没法再住那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't live in that place another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗  那些尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow me? All the bodies--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我们认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}people we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血和脑浆到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood, brains everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阴魂不散  -为什么不把尸体搬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's ghosts. - Why don't you move the bodies out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-应该把它们全烧了  -我们试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should be burning them. - We tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:04:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的  -监狱那头的栅栏坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We did. - The fence is down on the far side of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次我们把尸体搬出去  那些东西就守在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time we drag a body out, those things just line up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能把尸体扔下  赶紧逃回里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropping the body and just running back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们与托马斯和安德鲁毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we had nothing to do with Thomas and Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前那事  对我们已是警示\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to prove a point? You proved it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能加入你们  我们愿做牛做马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do whatever it takes to be part of your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我们待在那种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't make us live in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事没有商量余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our deal is not negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么待在那个牢区  要么离开监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either live in your cell block, or you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道这是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you this was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们和杀了我们同伴的人是一丘之貉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't no different than the pricks who shot up our boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这一周里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how many friends' corpses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搬了多少朋友的尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had to drag out this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么把他们扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just threw 'em out, like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:47.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是好人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humph. These were good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good guys who had our backs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵抗监狱里的恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the really bad dudes in the joint,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如托马斯和安德鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Thomas and Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都犯过错  才被关进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all made mistakes to get in here, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没打算装成圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna pretend to be a saint,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.67,0:05:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都已经付出了代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've paid our due--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们宁愿出去闯荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough that we would rather hit that road
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会再回那个狗窝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to go back into that shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.21,0:05:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们住你隔壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want them living in a cell next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.01,0:05:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会伺机抢走我们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll just be waiting for a chance to grab our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望睡不踏实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go back to sleeping with one eye open?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没睡踏实过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们加入吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them into the fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we send them off packing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就几乎是宣告了他们的死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might as well execute them ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  阿克塞尔情绪不太稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Axel seems a little unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们经历了那么多磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all we've been through?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才得到这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought so hard for all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们想窃取怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if they decide to take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直以来都是我们一起并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just been us for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是陌生人  我不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're strangers. I don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人突然在身边感觉有点怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels weird all of a sudden to have these other people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你当初也接受了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是你们出现时抱着个受伤的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you turned up with a shot boy in your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't give us a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们连杀行尸都不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't even kill walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归根结底  他们是罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're convicts, bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个或许还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two might actually
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们手上的人命多\N{\fnArial\fs30}have less blood on their hands than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get guys like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他们一起长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I grew up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很堕落  但不是精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're degenerates, but they ain't psychos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一念之差  说不定我也会进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have been in there with them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是跟你们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as easy as I'm out here with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以你同意我  -当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So are you with me? - Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:28.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们像我们一样去外边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em take their chances out on the road
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-碰碰运气  -我的意思是  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- just like we did. - What I'm saying, Daryl--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚当警察时  逮捕了个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a rookie, I arrested this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,19岁  因刺死女友而被通缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nineteen years old, wanted for stabbing his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子在审问和审判期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid blubbered like a baby
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哭得像个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the interrogation, during the trial--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺骗了陪审团\N{\fnArial\fs30}suckered the jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以证据不足为由无罪释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was acquitted due to insufficient evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两周之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, two weeks later,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又射杀了另外一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}shot another girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们经历了太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟他们的约定不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our deal with them stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要有更多弹药  我们可以解决一大群行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find more ammo, we could cut down a whole pack of biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你和安德莉亚今天要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you and Andrea are leaving today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就缺你这样的强手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use a soldier like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你不缺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem like you're holding your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连国民警卫队都被灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the National Guard was overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算受过军事训练  也应付不了行尸成群\N{\fnArial\fs30}No amount of training can prepare you for the world today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,士兵为什么不开车逃跑...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think one soldier would drive away--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸行动可很缓慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially against something so slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人很英雄主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men were heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会丢下自己人逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the kind to leave anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能早到点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only we'd gotten there sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多弹孔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of bullet holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸什么时候会用武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think biters figured out how to use weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们几星期前一定碰到土匪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have encountered bandits weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面世界很丑陋的  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ugly out there, but then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比任何人都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know that better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,韦尔斯身上发生的事太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad what happened to Welles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂文斯医生没能救活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Stevens couldn't revive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔在他脑袋上来了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle put a bullet in his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没举行葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们悄悄把他火葬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cremated him, quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人经历的悲痛太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people have been through so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地  还好他只是个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured, thank God, at least no one knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把车开到院子上边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the cars to the upper yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它们头朝外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point 'em facing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既不挡道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要的时候也能马上开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}but ready to go if we ever need to bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给那俩犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give the prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留能够吃一周的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a week's worth of supplies for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怕是撑不了一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might not last a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是他们的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's their choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们真有的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they really have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你手上想染上谁的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose blood would you rather have on your hands--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬的  格伦的  还是他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's, Glenn's, or theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁的也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双汽缸的  是胜利牌的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twin cylinder. Is that a Triumph?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让它更拉风吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't want it bored out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来发动机能调整一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like it could use a tune-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扳手活很厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty handy with a wrench.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水箱漏水了  我很懂摩托的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads are leakin'. I know my bikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你能别这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, will you just stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点种好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那么一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  别勉强自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:40.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也忍受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stand looking up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续看着那个床板了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at that bottom of that bunk anymore--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我觉得自己挺稳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think I'm pretty steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开了个好头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要休息一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to take a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们不如出去转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go for a little stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we leave soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黄昏前还能赶几小时路\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll got a few hours on the road before dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们往哪里走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想去海边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一面可以用海水做掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the water completely on one side,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准还能找条船\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we find a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好情况是找到个小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best thing we can do is find an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果海边也不安全呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the coast isn't safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就假设海边是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say the coast is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们干什么  慢慢变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do we do? Just grow old,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我们两人独居荒岛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}live off the sea by ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿冒着生命危险也不愿意留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather take my chances out there than stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你的直觉告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your gut tells
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方和总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}you there's something off about this place--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不太对劲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的直觉让我们活到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kept us alive this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些食物够你们坚持一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's enough food in there to last you guys a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来再放了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut you loose when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"谢了  兄弟"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thank you, bro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要我把她干掉吗  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should I take her out? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪械库未必有弹药  我们要省着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that armory hadn't been picked clean, we could spare the ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就开始做围栏  越早越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start making runs. The sooner the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽量在围栏里多扔点木头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll throw as much wood as we can in the dog run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大火不会吸引更多行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't the fire attract more walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们应该埋了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should bury them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在栅栏后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're behind the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好能一次性把尸体都处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth the one-time risk to get rid of the bodies for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想在烂肉上种庄稼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be planting crops in walker-rotted soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在前边保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you here if you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点下台阶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take your time on these steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把尸体都清出去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cleared all those bodies out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿开始像个真正能居住的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting to look like a place we could really live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好脚下的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不想你摔倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing we need is you falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真是个硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is one tough son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好吗  赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音放低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your cheers down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不能过一天好日子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man, can't we just have one good day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得很好  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing great, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:14:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好赛跑了吗  赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to race, Hershel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:59.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再给我一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就跟你较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸  小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开那里  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门锁  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lock-- hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个门开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gate is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bro, what about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在和达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I circled where you can
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待过的农场上做了标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}find that farm I was staying at with Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从九号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you were right off Route 9
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和达洛尼加高速公路直切过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}right before it becomes Dahlonega Highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说农场离那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're saying that the farmhouse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一天的路程吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is only about a day's walk from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们找索菲亚的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we looked for Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿也找过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even made it up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.10,0:18:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩怎么从没勾搭过\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come we never hooked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你原来叫我妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called me a whore...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Rod Muncher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我嘴比较毒  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a way with words, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.63,0:18:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我有家人  我也会担心他的安危\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd want the same thing if it was my family out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定不想跟我一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't wanna come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想知道那伙人的下落吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't curious about the old gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的也被遗弃了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah, you really was cut loose, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定回来过找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是没有呆在原地等他们而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't stick around to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你这是自我安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that a big ol' pig sack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有共同点  金发美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got something in common, blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.87,0:19:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被同一伙人遗弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got left behind by the same people...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又被另一伙人救下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saved by another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没想过离开这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever thought about leaving this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没理由离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had a reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督是个好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the Governor is a good man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just put it this way--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他发现我时  我就是个废人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't in the best of shape when he found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本可以弃我于不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should have just kept on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走  使劲拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Pull it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生了什么  -大门开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell happened?  - The gate was open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛丽呢  卡尔  其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Lori, Carl-- everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬带洛丽和卡尔进了C区  T仔被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie led Lori and Carl into C block. And T was bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不知道  -别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I couldn't tell. - Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些链子不可能是自己掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those chains didn't break on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人用斧子或锁剪打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone took an ax or cutters to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你认为是他们做的  -还会有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think they did it? - Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:34.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh-- you gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄停它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell can this be happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是备用发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa-whoa-whoa! It has to be the backup generators.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:20:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发电机怎么会打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do you turn those on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:21:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有三个是连着柴油机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's three that's connected to a diesel tank, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.89,0:21:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个控制着监狱的一个部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one controls a certain part of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱被侵占后它们都被关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hacks shut 'em all off when the prison was overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电力够的话  主门会被打开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can someone open up the main gates electronically with full power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只在这工作过几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only worked in there a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜应该可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it might be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快跟我们走  -我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come with us! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一组双扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a set of double doors
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直通一个过道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will lead to a corridor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让你重新回到牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll get you back to our cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你应该停下  -我要带你离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should stop. - I'm getting you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-停下  -怎么  坐在这儿等死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - Why? Sit here and wait to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽力帮你  你不会变成它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what I have to. You're not becoming one of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能要求你那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要互相帮助  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the pact, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is God's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.19,0:21:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会关照我的  永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll take care of me. Always has.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会帮助我带你逃出这个隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna help me lead you out of these tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你能跟得上吗  -我感觉不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you keep up? - Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你被咬了吗  -不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you bit? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像快生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the baby's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.61,0:21:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没时间了  折回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no time. Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.31,0:22:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打得好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该去奥古斯塔(高尔夫俱乐部)\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should visit Augusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让女人们好好玩儿一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take only the women and let them play.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.01,0:23:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将是历史性转折\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be historic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打破传统的枷锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And break decades of tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.39,0:23:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有些事情需要坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things are worth holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想带着提姆和马丁内斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was thinking of taking Tim and Martinez
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这周晚些时候外出行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}out on a scouting mission later on this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.32,0:23:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个金发女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说我弟弟还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said my brother was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你或许有机会找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can track with the best of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在就像大海捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's like a needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.67,0:24:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉了我她们暂居的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me where I could find that farmhouse
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.96,0:24:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,农场位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were holed up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.27,0:24:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.54,0:24:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他还活着  我一定可以找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's out there, I'll be able to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是行动过程中出现伤亡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if someone gets hurt during this search, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.08,0:24:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得上次克罗利的遭遇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What almost happened to Crowley last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就独自去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你的感受  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get what you're feeling, I really do,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.68,0:24:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不能冒这个险  这里需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't risk it. I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.33,0:24:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方不能没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole place would fall apart without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.95,0:24:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:24:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.91,0:25:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦你有了更可靠的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get more concrete information,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.10,0:25:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲自陪你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.81,0:25:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.19,0:25:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚又干掉了五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just took down five of them in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.90,0:25:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在里面干掉了四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were four in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没有洛莉和其它人的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no sign of Lori or any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.76,0:25:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能被逼进监狱深处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have been pushed back into the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在耍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody is playing games!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.78,0:25:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分头找其它人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll split up and look for the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.73,0:25:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管谁先到达发电机房  关掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever gets to the generators first, shut them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.87,0:25:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.84,0:25:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些警报是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those alarms?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警报招来行尸怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it attracts them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.87,0:25:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  赶紧躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, let's lay you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.07,0:25:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  孩子就要出生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-- the baby's coming now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.67,0:25:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回到囚室找赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get back to our cell block and have Hershel help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.69,0:25:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能碰到行尸  我们不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't risk getting caught out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.20,0:25:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里生小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to give birth to this baby here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.29,0:26:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.11,0:26:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么了  她好像呼吸困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she doing? Can't she breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.44,0:26:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没事  过来  把你的裤子脱下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine. Come here-- let's get your pants off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.08,0:26:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.15,0:26:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.71,0:26:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要帮忙接生你的弟弟或是妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to help deliver your brother or sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.95,0:26:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要检查一下  看你的宫口扩张没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do an exam. Let me see if you're dilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.20,0:26:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -你知道怎么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Do you know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.17,0:26:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸教过我  但这是我第一次自己接生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad taught me, but trust me, it's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.43,0:26:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我看不出来  -我要用力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't tell. - I gotta push.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要用力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta push.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.35,0:26:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  我没事  -还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm okay, I'm okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.99,0:26:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.82,0:26:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好  继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing great, Lori. Just keep doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟着感觉走就是了  顺其自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body knows what to do. Let it do all the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.06,0:26:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.92,0:27:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  停下来  有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, stop, don't push, something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.36,0:27:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.83,0:27:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.46,0:27:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  就快到了  -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. We're close. We're close! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.94,0:27:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.57,0:27:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  当我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to see you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来并不是所有人都喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place isn't for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.18,0:27:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你为我们做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you... for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.92,0:28:01.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you planning to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.74,0:28:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.58,0:28:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩说那里会比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne thinks it'll be safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.26,0:28:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.86,0:28:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  她的警惕使你们活到了现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, her vigilance has kept you both alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.13,0:28:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一段时间没喝烈酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh-- I haven't had hard liquor in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.68,0:28:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的酒量已经接近于零了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tolerance is probably close to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.52,0:28:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不喝也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔说你告诉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle told me you provided information
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.17,0:28:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他弟弟身处何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}about his brother's whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.14,0:28:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我能做的  虽然不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I could. It wasn't much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.43,0:28:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这给了他希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's given him hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他找不到他弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, I don't think he'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.19,0:28:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是他会去找  -会去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But he's gotta look-- - Gotta look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.64,0:28:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.93,0:28:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得能找到自己要找的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you'll find what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.39,0:28:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有家人活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still got family out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.67,0:28:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了所有亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.04,0:29:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父母  妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents, my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.57,0:29:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.10,0:29:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了妻子  是车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost my wife-- car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.87,0:29:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸潮爆发十八个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 months before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.64,0:29:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下我女儿和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just my daughter and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.54,0:29:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿明天更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}To better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.30,0:29:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是  我都不知道自己在寻找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I don't know what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.67,0:29:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长久以来  都是为了活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the longest time, it was all about survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.47,0:29:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.84,0:29:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以至于...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much so...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.71,0:29:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在都不知道什么重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.98,0:30:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还车贷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay off the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.11,0:30:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每周工作五十个小时  结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}work 50 hours a week, get married,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.93,0:30:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,买房子  不久前很多人为这些事情而活\N{\fnArial\fs30}buy a house-- that was survival for many not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多事情都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.32,0:30:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,环境会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scenery has.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.86,0:30:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风景会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.85,0:30:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们考虑问题的方式...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the way we think...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.74,0:30:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.32,0:30:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢美酒款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I appreciate the drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.69,0:30:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.12,0:30:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔会送你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle will see you out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.38,0:30:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给你备好武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'll have your weapons waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.85,0:30:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.76,0:30:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果外面的生活很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it gets tough out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.77,0:30:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里永远欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're always welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.07,0:30:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.46,0:30:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你  总督  -叫我菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Governor. - Philip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.52,0:30:56.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你不会告诉别人你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you never told anybody your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.63,0:30:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近有人告诉我"凡事无绝对"  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone recently told me never to say never, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.79,0:31:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.53,0:31:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.27,0:31:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  守住门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, get the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.18,0:31:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能把这关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you shut these down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.65,0:31:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去帮他  这里我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go help him. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.77,0:31:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.03,0:32:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打死他  我们能夺回监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him! We can take back this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.98,0:32:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愣着干什么  射啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you waiting for? Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的地盘  射他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our house. Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.16,0:33:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(注意安全)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.49,0:33:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.14,0:33:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.85,0:33:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  看着我  眼睛睁开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, look at me, look at me. Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.28,0:33:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把你送到赫谢尔那\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get you back to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.79,0:33:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.62,0:33:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  这么多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, with all this blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.45,0:33:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你的宫口还没完全打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even think you're fully dilated yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.08,0:33:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再用力也生不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No amount of pushing is gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.99,0:33:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂  我不会失去我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it means, and I'm not losing my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.00,0:33:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把我肚子切开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta cut me open.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.63,0:33:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  我做不到  -你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. I can't. - You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.46,0:33:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去找人帮忙  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go for help. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.99,0:33:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有卡萝尔练习过剖腹产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol's the one that practiced that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.23,0:33:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸只教过我简单步骤  洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad only taught me the steps, Lori. If I--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.04,0:33:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-拜托了  -我没麻醉药  也没设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - I have no anesthetic, no equipment--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.73,0:33:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔有把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl has a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.54,0:33:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就活不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.43,0:34:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的孩子必须活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby has to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.67,0:34:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.07,0:34:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了孩子  为了我们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby... for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.49,0:34:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Maggie! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.95,0:34:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.22,0:34:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以明天或后天再走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can always leave tomorrow or the following day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.86,0:34:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The following day?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.05,0:34:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该出去让自己身陷险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to walk into trouble that we can't get out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.21,0:34:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-里面也未必安全  -米琼恩  就留一两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me about it. - Michonne, it is just a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.85,0:34:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用重复  我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.08,0:34:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见以前剖腹产留下的疤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see my old C-section scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.47,0:34:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我做不到  -你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.81,0:34:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.87,0:34:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.28,0:34:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝不要害怕  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I don't want you to be scared, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.66,0:34:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我自愿的  这么做是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I want. This is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.38,0:35:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替我照顾好你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you-- you take care of your daddy for me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.53,0:35:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要照顾好你的弟弟或妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your little brother or sister, you take care--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.68,0:35:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.92,0:35:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能在这个世界生存  我知道你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna beat this world. I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.91,0:35:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你聪明  坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are smart, and you are strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.07,0:35:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常勇敢  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are so brave, and I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.07,0:35:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.89,0:35:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  有时候必须做对的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta do what's right, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.92,0:35:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应我  你会永远做对的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise me, you'll always do what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.91,0:35:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世界  做坏事很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so easy to do the wrong thing in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.55,0:35:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.90,0:35:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果感觉不对  就不要做  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if it feels wrong, don't do it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.18,0:35:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要选择轻松的那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it feels easy, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让这个世界污染你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let the world spoil you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.67,0:35:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.47,0:35:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my sweet boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.89,0:35:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我这辈子的骄傲  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best thing I ever did. And I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.36,0:36:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.87,0:36:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最最亲爱的孩子  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my sweet, sweet boy. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.01,0:36:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay-- okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.08,0:36:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.02,0:36:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  一切结束后你必须...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, when this is over, you're gonna have to--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别那样说  -必须杀了我  不能让瑞克来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shh-- - You have to do it. It can't be Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right... all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  吾爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.31,0:36:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.13,0:36:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.91,0:37:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, give me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.49,0:37:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要保证这里干净  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should keep the site clean, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.13,0:37:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切得太深  就会伤到婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut too deep, I'm gonna cut the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.04,0:37:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.23,0:37:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了  我看到耳朵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it. I see the ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备把孩子拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.17,0:37:26.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我分不清这是胳膊还是腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell if this is the arm or the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我把孩子拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna pull the baby out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.91,0:37:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.89,0:37:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.80,0:38:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.81,0:38:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能就这样走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.14,0:38:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会变行尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.98,0:38:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.81,0:38:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.63,0:38:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.71,0:38:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再把你当小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more kid stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.88,0:38:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人都有一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.21,0:38:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.41,0:38:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.17,0:39:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远无法心情平静的面对死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way you can ever be ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.84,0:40:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.49,0:40:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没找到他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.11,0:40:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还以为他们回了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought maybe they came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.08,0:40:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-T仔呢  卡萝尔呢  -他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about T? Carol? - They didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.90,0:40:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,T仔死了不代表卡萝尔也死了  我们再进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't mean the others didn't. We're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.14,0:40:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔和格伦  你们跟我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl and Glenn, you come with--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.98,0:41:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where-- where is she? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.57,0:41:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  瑞克  别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... Rick, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.09,0:41:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.48,0:41:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!